"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186990/extras/4ca5c7cd0eba702a9ce4101757152fd1.poster.avif?t=1770021946\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186990/extras/4ca5c7cd0eba702a9ce4101757152fd1.webm?t=1770021946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186990/extras/4ca5c7cd0eba702a9ce4101757152fd1.mp4?t=1770021946\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle a wide variety of foes, each with distinct patterns, strengths, and weaknesses. Success demands both skill and preparation. Engage in reactive melee combat, unleash spells with precision, and adapt your tactics on the fly. Your build matters\u2014but so does how you wield it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Progression</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fatekeeper offers rich progression mechanics that go far beyond surface-level stats. Build and refine your character with meaningful choices across combat styles, attributes, and spell schools. Whether you lean into raw strength, nimble precision, or devastating sorcery, the game supports a wide range of viable and unique builds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Armor &amp; Weapons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186990/extras/67417be775ed82bcbd79c3de9e3d5288.poster.avif?t=1770021946\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186990/extras/67417be775ed82bcbd79c3de9e3d5288.webm?t=1770021946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186990/extras/67417be775ed82bcbd79c3de9e3d5288.mp4?t=1770021946\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover, loot, and master a wide variety of weapons, armor, and artifacts. Customize your loadout to suit your playstyle, and experiment with powerful combinations to overcome increasingly challenging enemies. Every item matters\u2014and the right gear can be the difference between victory and ruin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Paraglacial"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186990/b1bd8cbde331f9eac06c8a34bbc1b55b5350b88a/header.jpg?t=1770021946","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 by THQ Nordic GmbH, Austria. Developed by Paraglacial. Published by THQ Nordic GmbH. Fatekeeper is a registered trademark of THQ Nordic AB, Sweden. All other brands, product names and logos are trademarks or registered trademarks of their respective owners.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2186990/1973055756/6ac5b90d8c809b2368d33298e5185f188a0a654b/1754066682/dash_av1.mpd?t=1754076119","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2186990/1973055756/6ac5b90d8c809b2368d33298e5185f188a0a654b/1754066682/dash_h264.mpd?t=1754076119","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2186990/1973055756/6ac5b90d8c809b2368d33298e5185f188a0a654b/1754066682/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1754076119","id":257176940,"name":"Announcement Trailer Showcase 2025","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257176940/42748f3de113fd1e